set.body:
Represent known structure by changing the optimization domain.

Families:
- known support W = E_S Z;
- null-space elimination for exact linear equalities;
- block and shared-basis parameterizations;
- fixed-rank factorization B = U V* with explicit gauge symmetry.

Each Parameterization records injectivity, image/surjectivity claim, redundant coordinates, gauge group, differential/JVP/VJP, and semantic lifting/inversion behavior.

Acceptance:
- direct semantic-versus-parameterized objective equivalence tests;
- rank tolerance and null-space basis provenance;
- gauge-equivalent factors lift to the same semantic object;
- result contract reports non-identifiability introduced by redundant coordinates;
- JVM/JS green.
